### Assign driver
POST http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "order_id": 1001,
  "user_id": 42,
  "user_email": "user@example.com",
  "delivery_address": "Abay 10, Almaty"
}

### Update driver location
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/location
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "driver_id": 1,
  "latitude": 43.238949,
  "longitude": 76.889709
}

### Get delivery history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/history
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Track delivery
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/1/track
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Complete delivery
POST http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get delivery
GET http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cancel delivery
POST http://localhost:8080/api/delivery/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
